          <caption>
            <p>Hilar Adenopathy. This chest radiograph&#x000a0;of a young child demonstrates hilar adenopathy but little parenchymal disease.&#x000a0;The tuberculosis skin test was positive.&#x000a0; Contributed by&#x000a0;A Ahmed, MD</p>
