            <p>Lymph Node Disease With Airway Compression. This chest radiograph&#x000a0;of&#x000a0;a young child demonstrates lymph node disease in the hilar area, creating airway compression and subsequent area of atelectasis due to active Mtb disease. Contributed by A Ahmed, MD</p>
          </caption>
