            <p>Lymph Node Disease. This is an image of a 4-year-old Hispanic child with persistent right neck adenitis who was unresponsive to an Amoxicillin course. Progression of the lymph node disease presenting with a reddish-purple hue is also seen in the atypical mycobacterial disease. Interferon-gamma&#x000a0;release assay testing for&#x000a0;tuberculosis&#x000a0;was positive. Contributed by A Ahmed, MD</p>
