          <caption>
            <p>Tuberculosis Meningitis. Magnetic resonance imaging of an 8-month-old infant with recent travel to South Africa, presenting with unremitting fever, pneumonia, and progressive lethargy. MRI demonstrating hydrocephalus and basilar enhancement characteristic of <italic toggle="yes">M tuberculosis</italic> meningitis. Contributed by A Ahmed, MD</p>
          </caption>
          <graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="MTB__Meningitis" position="float" orientation="portrait"/>
